      "claim_record_id": "ni:///sha-256;fYYFbxy8A7KxihhKUEM6NRkaapRATE_I1gWxEoJz1ew",
      "formal_verification_status": "source-reported only; inspect exact assessment records",
      "human_review_status": "no independent human review documented by the seed",
      "independent_reproduction_status": "none documented by the seed",
      "latex": "\\begin{gathered}m\\ge2,\\quad0\\ne\\ell\\in V_{2m+1}^\\vee,\\quad\\rho=\\operatorname{rank}C_\\ell,\\\\E_c(X_\\ell^{m,m+1};u,v)\\ne(uv)^{2m+1},\\\\\\rho=1:\\ E_c=(uv)^{2m+1}-(uv)^{2m};\\\\\\rho=2\\text{ secant}:\\ [u^{2m-1}v^{2m-1}]E_c=-2;\\quad\\rho=2\\text{ first jet}:\\ [u^{2m-1}v^{2m-1}]E_c=-1;\\\\\\rho\\ge3:\\ [u^{2m-1}v^{2m-1}]E_c=-1;\\\\X_\\ell^{m,m+1}\\not\\simeq\\mathbb A^{2m+1}.\\end{gathered}",
      "natural": "Let m>=2, 0!=ell in V_{2m+1}^*, and rho=rank C_ell. Then E_c(X_ell^{m,m+1};u,v)!=(uv)^{2m+1}. More precisely, for rho=1 the polynomial is (uv)^{2m+1}-(uv)^{2m}; for catalecticant rank two of two-point secant type the coefficient of u^{2m-1}v^{2m-1} is -2; for rank two of first-jet type it is -1; and for rho>=3 it is -1. Consequently X_ell^{m,m+1} is not isomorphic to A^{2m+1} for every such m and ell.",
